# NOTICE

This repository contains original skill guidance informed by official Godot engine source, official Godot documentation, Blender documentation, and comparative public research. No engine, documentation, or third-party skill files are vendored.

The 2026-10-23 core guidance refresh used Godot `4.7.2-stable` and the matching `4.7` documentation. The optional editor adapter was checked against `hi-godot/godot-ai` `v4.3.0`. Exact revisions and the earlier 2026-07-10 authoring baseline are recorded in [source provenance](docs/source-provenance.md). Blender and glTF sources are linked in the [Blender pipeline](skills/godot-best-practice/references/blender-pipeline.md).

Earlier design research consulted these public Godot agent-skill examples:

- [Godot skill listing](https://mcp.directory/skills/godot)
- [bfollington/terma](https://github.com/bfollington/terma)
- [fernforestgames/agent-skill-godot](https://github.com/fernforestgames/agent-skill-godot)

Their skill files are not copied here. `scripts/check_gdscript.sh` is an original implementation whose validation route was checked against Godot documentation and `main/main.cpp`.
